<view class="page"><view class="panel"><text class="title">库存实操</text><text class="sub">根据库存水位提交补货。</text><text class="stat">可用库存：{{inventory.available}} 件｜在途：{{inventory.inTransit}} 件｜补货点：{{inventory.reorderPoint}} 件</text><input type="number" placeholder="补货数量" value="{{quantity}}" bindinput="onInput"/><button bindtap="onReorder">提交补货</button><button bindtap="onBack">返回店铺</button></view></view>